  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Starting with Kubernetes 1.25 on Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS), the operating system AKS uses for Ubuntu based node pools will be changing from Ubuntu 18 to Ubuntu 22.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Azure/AKS/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more.</a></p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Starting with Kubernetes 1.25 on Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS), the operating system AKS uses for Ubuntu based node pools will be changing from Ubuntu 18 to Ubuntu 22.\n\nLearn more."
  },
